                                                "sense_id": "035c1109-87f1-30a4-a4a1-55b6fd337a42",
                                                "text": "By quarter to six all this had me so awake and agitated that even the Balinese wind chimes that I hung up in the garden to relax me began to sound like Big Ben."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
